+/**
+ * Local S2 (2026-10-29): GPU front end for the srsUE NR downlink, see ue_dl_cuda.h.
+ * Built only with SRSRAN_LDPC_CUDA=ON (OCUDU lib/phy/cuda headers + libocudu_phy_cuda.a, cuFFT).
